# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repository and check it out as LF on every platform.
#
# Rationale: the same tree is edited on Windows and built/tested on Linux CI runners (plus Windows
# agents for the pipeline tasks), so one convention removes the "LF will be replaced by CRLF" churn
# that `core.autocrlf=true` produces for every file a tool rewrites, and keeps diffs, blob hashes and
# the packaged VSIX identical across machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted (git normally detects these, but being explicit removes any
# smudge/clean surprise in a package we publish).
*.png binary
*.vsix binary
*.zip binary
